lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.name=Harmony of the forest
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.harmony.text=The forest weighs how you walk in it. Peaceful time among the trees mends your Harmony, while harming its creatures wounds it; the leaf shows where you stand. Those who keep the peace long become Friends of Lothlórien, and one wrong deed loses it again.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.name=Our people
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.elves.text=Our people are few, and no new elves are born. Only the wardens at the border return, and the healers keep the rest alive. Raise your hand against one of us, and the price is dear.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.name=Renown
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.renown.text=As you do deeds and tasks for my kin, your Renown among us grows. It is never lost, and word of it travels to every village. The higher it stands, the more the elves will offer you.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.name=Dew of the morning
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.dew.text=At first light the leaves weep silver. Dew gathers in the morning on leaf litter and blossoms that lie beneath Mallorn leaves. Fill a glass bottle from each dewy patch, for every patch gives one drop and eight fill the bottle.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.name=Mallorn nectar
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.nectar.text=Nectar blooms hang beneath the Mallorn leaves and fill in four stages. Fill a glass bottle from a full bloom, and the bloom begins to fill again.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.name=Depth of the wood
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.depth.text=Near the edge of Lothlórien the border wardens walk in numbers; deeper in they grow fewer, except on the wooden decks of our villages. The deeper you walk, the more often you meet the rarest creatures of the wood.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.name=Lembas
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.lembas.text=Plant Western Corn and gather its grain. Mix the grain with sugar to make dough; bake the dough, then wrap the cake in a Mallorn leaf. Wrapped Lembas feeds well and lifts Hunger, the food for a long road.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.name=Fireflies
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.fireflies.text=After dusk, fireflies drift above the grass of the wood. A firefly in a bottle is a small light to carry, or a gift for the lamplighter.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.name=Elven rope
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.rope.text=Elven rope is made of morning dew and a golden fern, and a whole dawn of gathering goes into one. Use it on the side of a block, and it runs the whole way down or up if you have enough of it; if not, it can be lengthened later. It can be climbed.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.name=Gifts of the forest
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.gifts.text=Deer love Western Corn, and a deer that is fed will trust you. A Friend of Lothlórien may offer a Mallorn acorn to a squirrel, and it may bring you a gift in return.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.name=The white ones
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.white_animals.text=Rare white creatures walk the deepest wood. To a friend of the forest they may give, or they may carry. Keep your Harmony high, and be patient.
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.name=Fine goods
lothlorien.message.lore.lesson.trades.text=To one who is an Elf-friend and also a Friend of Lothlórien, my kin may offer our finest goods. They cannot be found anywhere else.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_acorns.text=The gardener asks a kindness: five Mallorn acorns set in the earth beneath the eaves of the wood. Plant them inside the forest, and let them stand.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_dew.text=The gardener asks for two Bottles of morning dew, to wake the young trees.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.g_bonemeal.text=The gardener asks for sixteen bone meal, to feed the young trees.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_athelas.text=The healer asks for four Athelas, the kingsfoil that mends the wounded.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_nectar.text=The healer asks for two bottles of Mallorn nectar, for the sick.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.h_flowers.text=The healer asks for four Elanor and four Niphredil, flowers of the deep wood.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_logs.text=The woodwright asks for thirty-two logs of birch or cherry, in any mix.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_fletching.text=The woodwright asks for eight string and eight feathers, for the fletching of arrows.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.w_iron.text=The woodwright asks for six iron ingots, for tools.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_fireflies.text=The lamplighter asks for three bottles of fireflies, to light the lanterns.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_coal.text=The lamplighter asks for sixteen coal or charcoal, in any mix, for the lamps.
lothlorien.message.lore.req.l_glass.text=The lamplighter asks for sixteen glass, for the lanterns.
